  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The essence of alliance agreements is information path methods that leave information path dao marks on both the body and the soul. Removing the agreement means removing those marks. On Hei Lou Lan, some of those marks represent the mutual-release condition that if one side breaks the agreement, the other need not follow it, and those marks relate to the rest of the agreement’s marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1031
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dao marks of different paths resist and conflict with each other. An information path insignia on flying sword Immortal Gu still holds a trace of information path dao marks while sitting in a container of sword path dao marks for a long time, which the novel compares to a ship unmoved by surrounding currents.",
      "chapters": [
        1102
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "insignia-on-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Earth Mother Altar, incense smoke merges into each Gu Immortal and adds information path dao marks, an ancient method that makes them members of the four races alliance. Fang Yuan judges that the method uses earth path to achieve an information path effect rather than an orthodox information path method alone.",
      "chapters": [
        1146
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-incense",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_earth_mother",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_four_races_alliance",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit says that according to legends, wisdom Gu’s recipe contains a large amount of information path immortal materials, and that in nature a wild wisdom Gu can only complete its advancement in areas full of information path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1562
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-gu-advancement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Profound Literature grotto-heaven mainly has information path dao marks, so its environment suits information path resources, and the Gu Masters and Gu Immortals there mainly cultivate information path and use information path Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        1684
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "grotto-heaven-resources",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_profound_literature_grotto_heaven",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Central Continent Gu Immortal judges Wen Xiu’s Censure Peak man-made and full of information path dao marks, akin to half a secluded domain of heaven and earth.",
      "chapters": [
        1836
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
